    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a small world where your cursor transforms into a 3D cursor. Whether you're a fan of idle games or just like to swing your mouse, <i>Curse the Cursor is for you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between two opposite gameplay modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parker Mode:</strong> Test your patience by doing absolutely nothing\u2014just don\u2019t move your cursor. Every second counts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonstop Mode:</strong> Never stop moving your cursor! Traverse the map with it, covering as much distance as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your experience with customizable skins, effects and backgrounds. Do not forget that stats you grinded lead your way to the top of the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead and Curse your Cursor.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a small world where your cursor transforms into a 3D cursor. Whether you're a fan of idle games or just like to swing your mouse, <i>Curse the Cursor is for you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between two opposite gameplay modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parker Mode:</strong> Test your patience by doing absolutely nothing\u2014just don\u2019t move your cursor. Every second counts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonstop Mode:</strong> Never stop moving your cursor! Traverse the map with it, covering as much distance as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your experience with customizable skins, effects and backgrounds. Do not forget that stats you grinded lead your way to the top of the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead and Curse your Cursor.</p>",
    "short_description": "An idle game with two opposite modes. --Parker Mode: Do not move your cursor!-- --Nonstop Mode: Move your cursor!-- Customize your game with skins, effects, and backgrounds.",
